  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/06/IMG_6765.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>(56 fotos) El pub Flamenkito, en la avenida Pa&iacute;s Valenci&agrave;, 110 de Onda, ha celebrado este s&aacute;bado su primer aniversario, con el concierto del duo KuerdaP@Rato. La noche y la madrugada ha estado muy animada, con muchas personas que hab&iacute;an participado en la romer&iacute;a rociera al Salvador.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/flamenkito1eraniversarikuerdaparato/img_6709.jpg\" alt=\"img_6709\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/flamenkito1eraniversarikuerdaparato/img_6710.jpg\" alt=\"img_6710\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/flamenkito1eraniversarikuerdaparato/img_6711.jpg\" alt=\"img_6711\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/flamenkito1eraniversarikuerdaparato/img_6712.jpg\" alt=\"img_6712\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/flamenkito1eraniversarikuerdaparato/img_6713.jpg\" alt=\"img_6713\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/flamenkito1eraniversarikuerdaparato/img_6714.jpg\" alt=\"img_6714\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/flamenkito1eraniversarikuerdaparato/img_6715.jpg\" alt=\"img_6715\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/flamenkito1eraniversarikuerdaparato/img_6716.jpg\" alt=\"img_6716\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2